## Impact

It allows an attacker to mint new tokens without proper checks and validations, which can result in an inflation of the total supply of tokens and a loss of funds for the contract's owner or users. The contract's "mint" function allows the attacker to mint new tokens without any restrictions

## Proof of Concept

#### code 

